{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00242",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.22,
      "end_seconds": 4.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. Can I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.2,
      "end_seconds": 8.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.81,
      "end_seconds": 17.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "I've been getting breathless walking short distances, and I wanted to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.01,
      "end_seconds": 20.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.07,
      "end_seconds": 24.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "It's been nearly five years, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.3,
      "end_seconds": 28.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.41,
      "end_seconds": 34.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Hmm, I notice it more with walking uphill. It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.76,
      "end_seconds": 36.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.28,
      "end_seconds": 45.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get occasional wheeze as well. The occasional wheeze? That's been for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.4,
      "end_seconds": 50.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.16,
      "end_seconds": 54.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Well, I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.23,
      "end_seconds": 57.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Any night sweats or leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.74,
      "end_seconds": 60.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.48,
      "end_seconds": 62.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.94,
      "end_seconds": 66.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Well, no weight loss, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.61,
      "end_seconds": 71.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.45,
      "end_seconds": 75.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Yes, ibuprofen, it gives me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.71,
      "end_seconds": 76.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.57,
      "end_seconds": 81.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.62,
      "end_seconds": 88.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "Alright, any long-term health problems I should know about? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.54,
      "end_seconds": 94.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Oh, I have high blood pressure, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.82,
      "end_seconds": 107.15,
      "duration_seconds": 11.33,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. What medicines are you taking at the moment? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.07,
      "end_seconds": 111.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I take losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.25,
      "end_seconds": 125.6,
      "duration_seconds": 13.35,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.93,
      "end_seconds": 128.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.03,
      "end_seconds": 131.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.02,
      "end_seconds": 133.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.63,
      "end_seconds": 148.63,
      "duration_seconds": 14.0,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.75,
      "end_seconds": 154.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Hmm, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.65,
      "end_seconds": 158.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.25,
      "end_seconds": 159.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.68,
      "end_seconds": 163.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.99,
      "end_seconds": 181.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "There are fine crackles at the bases of both lungs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.69,
      "end_seconds": 182.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.17,
      "end_seconds": 186.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.98,
      "end_seconds": 202.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "No clubbing in the fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.42,
      "end_seconds": 225.69,
      "duration_seconds": 19.27,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.48,
      "end_seconds": 233.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.79,
      "end_seconds": 250.57,
      "duration_seconds": 15.78,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been getting breathless walking short distances for nearly five years, moderate, and no weight loss or night sweats."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.82,
      "end_seconds": 254.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "That's it, um, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.35,
      "end_seconds": 262.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "I'm going to order breathing tests, for chronic breathlessness. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.13,
      "end_seconds": 266.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.16,
      "end_seconds": 280.11,
      "duration_seconds": 12.95,
      "text": "Try a daily walk and note how far you get before you need to stop. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. I'll also refer you to a chest physician."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.0,
      "end_seconds": 281.7,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.57,
      "end_seconds": 289.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.05,
      "end_seconds": 293.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Yes, uh, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.51,
      "end_seconds": 302.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "Please come and see me after the results are back. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.01,
      "end_seconds": 309.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "So, um, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.57,
      "end_seconds": 315.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.75,
      "end_seconds": 319.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    }
  ]
}